# Line endings are load-bearing in two places, and git must not negotiate them.
# Covers: EC24   Lot: L2   Competency: C4

* text=auto

# sql/initdb/*.sh RUNS INSIDE THE POSTGRES CONTAINER. A CRLF copy fails there
# with "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M", and the cluster is then initialised
# WITHOUT the airflow and mlflow databases. The entrypoint never replays that
# directory, so the only way back is to drop the volume -- twenty minutes to
# diagnose the first time it happened.
*.sh    text eol=lf

# The Windows side of the project is CRLF and strict ASCII by convention.
*.ps1   text eol=crlf

*.png   binary
